Translated from Korean to English; frontmatter, paths, frozen statuses (`implemented`, `accepted`), `commands.verify` and `sh tests/test-all.sh` are unchanged.
Headings mapped to Context, Decision, Alternatives and Consequences; the nested list under the three responsibilities keeps its structure.
